# Revisions to skip when running git blame: bulk reformats, no behavior change.
#
# Enable locally (once per clone):
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub honors this file automatically, no config needed.
#
# Only ever add a commit here that is PURELY mechanical. A commit with real
# changes mixed in would make blame permanently skip that authorship, which is
# worse than having no file at all.

# (Pending) Prettier adoption sweep. Append the commit SHA here once the
# formatting commit exists, since a commit cannot contain its own hash.
